% asdg
# Fixture proving the `gen` argument of a_effective_founders_boichard selects
# the reference population. pedformat asdg. Every animal has both parents, so
# the disputed one-parent-known branch (BL-3) is NOT exercised.
#
#   1..4  founders, generation 1
#   5,6   1 x 2, generation 2   -- descend from founders 1,2 ONLY
#   7     5 x 6, generation 3
#   8     3 x 4, generation 3   -- brings founders 3,4 into generation 3
#
# reference = generation 2 -> founders 1,2 contribute 0.5 each, 3,4 contribute 0
#             sum q^2 = 0.5      f_e = 2
# reference = generation 3 -> all four contribute 0.25
#             sum q^2 = 0.25     f_e = 4
1 0 0 1
2 0 0 1
3 0 0 1
4 0 0 1
5 1 2 2
6 1 2 2
7 5 6 3
8 3 4 3
